# Brazen Blademaster: the "while you control two or more artifacts" is checked as the attack is declared, not when the trigger resolves
# (it is not an intervening if, CR 603.4). Bot1 attacks with Mox Ruby and Mox Jet in play; Bot2 responds with Shatter on Mox Jet, leaving
# Bot1 one artifact, yet the Blademaster still resolves to a 4/4 and deals 4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mountain
Brazen Blademaster
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Shatter
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Brazen Blademaster.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Brazen Blademaster > Bot2)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Shatter.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Brazen Blademaster.Power = 4
Bot2.Life = 16
